{
  "id": "MRK.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mariko 7",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okoiraneria abwo baare koengereria ekiagera aborokigwa baye tibabwateti chingencho chi’abagaaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 15:1-20)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abafarisai na abande ase aborokia b’amariiko barwete Yerusalemu, bagasangererekana asare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakarora abande baborokigwa baye bakoragera namaboko are neriko, engencho yaye ataisabiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Inaki Abafarisai na Abayahudi bonsi tibakoragera ritang’ani bataraisaba amaboko. Igo babwatetie engencho y’abagaaka babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende kobakorwa echiiro, tibakoria batesibetie. Naende nchire chingencho chinde babwate buna ogosibia ebikombe ne chinyongo, na ebinto bie chitaai.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Abafarisai baria na aborokia b’amariiko bakabooria Yeso, “Nase ki aborokigwa bao batari kobwata chingencho chi’abagaaka, korende bakoragera namaboko are neriko?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabateebia Isaya nigo abaanete buya igoro yaino, inwe abang’ainereria, buna eriikire;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto aba nigo bansigete ase ebikoba biabo igoro,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "korende chinkoro chiabo nigo chire aare korwa ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abwo nigo bagonsasiima ogosasiima kwa bosa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "bakworokereria amorokererio ayare amachiiko a Mwanyabaanto oka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo mogotiga richiiko ria Nyasae, mwabwata chingencho chia Mwanyabaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akagenderera kobateebia, “Mwangire richiiko ria Nyasae ng’a monyare kobwata chingencho chiaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inaki Musa nigo ateebete: Sika iso na nyoko, na: Oyorakwane bobe ase ise, gose ase ng’ina, ogokwa nakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende inwe moteeba: Omonto karateebie ise gose ng’ina: Bionsi ebi anga kwanyora korwa ase ’nde nakio Korbani (engencho yaye: Ebiarurwe ase Nyasae) —",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "timori komotiga naende amokorere ise gose ng’ina ring’ana rinde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo mogosaria ring’ana ria Nyasae ase chingencho chiaino chia kare. Naende amange mwakorire mware koenana omogwekano bw’ayio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso akarangeria omoganda naende, akayoteebia, “Nyigwe mwensi, naende manya:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari egento kere isiko y’omonto, na gekomosoa, keranyare komobekera ogotacheneka, korende ebikorwa ase omonto nabio bikomobekera ogotacheneka. [",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto kare namato akoigwera, tiga aigwe.]”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goika agachia gosoa nyomba, gatigire omoganda, aborokigwa baye bakamobooria amang’ana y’omobayeeno oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Nonya ninwe timori nobong’aini? Timomanyeti ng’a kera egento kere isiko y’omonto gokeramosoe, tigekonyara komobekera ogotacheneka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera tigekomosoa enkoro, otatiga ase enda yoka, erio kiagwa kebara?” (Ase ogoteeba igo, osibirie chindagera chionsi.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabora “Ekegosoka korwa ase omonto nakio gekomobekera ogotacheneka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera ime ase chinkoro chi’ abanto nigo bikorwao ebirengererio ebibe, obonyaka, oboibi, oboiti, obotomani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okogania okobe, obobe, obong’ainereria, oboenenu, ribero, oborami, obwerori, oboriri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya onsi amabe nigo akorwa ime, naro akobekera omonto ogotacheneka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okwegena kw’omokuungu oyomo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 15:21-28)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akaimoka korwa aria, akagenda goika omochie o Turo. Agasoa ase enyomba, akarigia tamanyekana na monto, korende tanyara kobiseka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agwo omokungu oyomo, omwana oye enyaroka obwatire nekerecha ki’eubi, akaigwa amang’ana aye, agacha akamogwera ase amagoro aye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria n’Omogiriki orenge, egesaku kiaye n’Omosurofenisia. Akamosaba amosererie ekerecha korwa ase enyaroka yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akamoteebia, “Tiga abana baigote ritang’ani, ekiagera tari buya kobogoria endagera y’abana, gotugutera chisese.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omokungu oria akamoiraneria, “Nab’Omonene, nonya nechisese nyaro ye chimesa nigo chikoria amatori y’abana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akamoteebia, “Ase engencho ye ring’ana eri, genda bwoo, ekerecha kiarure ase enyaroka yao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagenda mwaye, akanyora omwana oria bwareirie borere, na ekerecha keria kiamorure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso Okogwenia omonto orenge omotiino naende rimama",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 15:29-31)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso akarua agwo ase ensemo ya Turo, agaeta gati‐gati ya Sidoni, akagenda goika enyancha ya Galili, egati y’ensemo ya Dekapoli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamorentera omonto ore omotiino, naende nigo are gotutura kagokwana; bagasorora Yeso abeeke okoboko kwaye igoro asare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akamwatanana korwa ase omoganda bobisi, akabeeka ebiara biaye ase amato aye, agatwa amate, akamokuna oromeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akarigereria gochia igoro, agaita egekoe, akamoteebia, “Efatha,” engencho yaye, “Igoreka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwango amato aye agatiinoka, egesibo ki’oromeme rwaye gekororoba, agakwana buya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabatianera tibateebia monto, korende buna amentete kobakania, naboigo bamentete koraria amang’ana aya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bagakumia mono kobua, bakaboora, “Okorire onsi buya. Abarenge emetiino obatiinoire, na abarenge amamama bakwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.7.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
